        <title>How to reliably save game state</title>
        <published>2020-01-09T00:00:00+00:00</published>
        <updated>2020-01-09T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
        
        <author>
          <name>Unknown</name>
        </author>
        
        <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://loftafi.github.io/posts/save-game-state/"/>
        <id>https://loftafi.github.io/posts/save-game-state/</id>
        
        <content type="html" xml:base="https://loftafi.github.io/posts/save-game-state/">&lt;h2 id=&quot;how-to-reliably-save-game-state&quot;&gt;How to reliably save game state?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;How do you safely and reliably save your game state? Create a function that
&lt;code&gt;serialize&lt;/code&gt;s all game state into a text or binary format. This may include
player scores, achievements, backpack contents, map location. Create
another function to &lt;code&gt;deserialize&lt;/code&gt; from this text or binary format back
into your game memory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;giallo z-l-code z-d-code&quot; &gt;&lt;code data-lang=&quot;zig&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;pub&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; const&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt; GameState&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; =&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; struct&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; {&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;    pub&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; const&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt; save_filename&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; =&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-6&quot;&gt; &amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-6&quot;&gt;game.dat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-6&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;    score&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; u64&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;    achievements&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt; ArrayList&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;Achievement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-3&quot;&gt;    //&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-3&quot;&gt; Convert the game state to a data string.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;    pub&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; fn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt; serialize&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;state&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; *&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;GameState&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;) []&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;const&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; u8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; { &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-3&quot;&gt;    //&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-3&quot;&gt; Convert save file data back into game state.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;    pub&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; fn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt; deserialize&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;state&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; *&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;GameState&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;) []&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;const&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; u8&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; { &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-3&quot;&gt;    //&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-3&quot;&gt; Save the data string to disk&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;    pub&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; fn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt; save&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;state&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; *&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;const&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt; GameState&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;void&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; { &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The mistake people commonly make, is to overwrite the existing game file
with the new data. The problem with this, if the write fails, you may
end up with an empty or incomplete game state file.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;First write the game state to a temporary file such as
&lt;code&gt;game.json.202302050150&lt;/code&gt; and after writing succeeds, rename/move the
temporary file into the place of the &lt;code&gt;game.json&lt;/code&gt; file.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;giallo z-l-code z-d-code&quot; &gt;&lt;code data-lang=&quot;zig&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-3&quot;&gt;///&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-3&quot;&gt; Save the game state&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;pub&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; fn&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt; save&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;state&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; *&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;const&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt; GameState&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt; gpa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt; std&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;mem&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;Allocator&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;void&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; {&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-3&quot;&gt;    //&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-3&quot;&gt; Add the current time to the save filename&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;    const&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt; temp_name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; =&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; try&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt; std&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt;allocPrint&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;gpa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-6&quot;&gt; &amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-6&quot;&gt;{s}.{d}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-2 z-d-6&quot;&gt;&amp;quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; .&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;        save_filename&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;        std&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;time&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt;milliTimestamp&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    })&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;    defer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt; gpa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt;free&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;temp_name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-3&quot;&gt;    //&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-3&quot;&gt; Step 1: Write the game state to a temporary file.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;    const&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt; data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; =&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt; state&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt;serialize&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;    var&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt; file&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; =&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; try&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt; std&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;fs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt;cwd&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt;createFile&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;temp_name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; .&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;{})&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;    defer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt; file&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt;close&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;    _&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt; =&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt; file&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt;write&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;catch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; {&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;        return&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;    }&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-3&quot;&gt;    //&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-5 z-d-3&quot;&gt; Step 2: move the temporary file onto the real file.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-8 z-d-10&quot;&gt;    try&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt; std&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;fs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt;cwd&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-6 z-d-7&quot;&gt;rename&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt;temp_name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;z-l-9 z-d-12&quot;&gt; save_filename&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;span class=&quot;giallo-l&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;</content>
        
